	(text "Sunflower 4-layer density study (pn-dense-1d): 67-LED dense Penrose P3 tiling of XL-1615RGBC-RF LEDs (rhomb vertices, 2.547 mm closest pair) in a 38 mm disc: 66 on 1x AW20198QNR, the centre LED on RP2350 GPIO7/8/9; USB-C on the back, light sensor at the rim, 4-layer JLCPCB.\n38 mm round board, Vogel-spiral LED field, 35 mm round LiPo cell behind the board.\nSolid GND thermal pads on U3, U5, and all AW20198QNR QFN-40 drivers (0 via-in-pad)."
